      "id": "sync",
      "name": "Sync",
      "category": "ClothingSimulationInteractor",
      "signature": "Sync(Target, Simulation, Context)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UClothingSimulationInteractor*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Simulation",
          "type": "IClothingSimulation*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Context",
          "type": "IClothingSimulationContext*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Sync the interactor to the provided context for the clothing simulation to use\non its next update. This will be called at a time that is guaranteed to\nnever overlap with the running simulation. The simulation will have to be\nwritten in a way to pick up these changes on the next update.\nAny inherited class must call this function to also Sync the ClothingInteractors."
    },
